  "notes": "Sequence from the official Manual de Avalúo Académico (May 2025); requirements from the Undergraduate Catalog 2023-2027 (rev. Mar 19, 2026). Program offered in Hato Rey, San Sebastián and Caguas; 122 credits; all major courses require a minimum grade of C. LAB CREDIT NOTES: the assessment manual displays BIO 1222 as 4 cr with LB 1222 as 0 cr; the catalog (the degree-requirements authority) splits them 3+1 — seeded per the catalog (pair total 4 either way; period and program totals unchanged). LCF 1001 (Physical Sciences lab, co-requisite of CIF 1001) and LC 3000 (Forensic Chemistry lab, co-requisite of CHE 3000) appear as genuine 0-credit labs in the manual's official sequence but are not listed in the catalog's program blocks; seeded as required_zero with the manual as source. Manual year-header typos ('Primer año' printed where 'Primer periodo' is meant) are harmless. Manual prereq strings for FSC 3004/3005 cite old 'BIO 1201' codes; catalog Core lists BIO 1220/LB 1220.",
